    <string name="primedgun_section_useful_info">Useful Information</string>
    <string name="primedgun_about_useful_info_text">• Leave the game with Quit in the Quest menu, or with Stop on the Setup tab. The game saves its settings as it exits.\n\n• The first start after an update compiles shaders in the background; later starts are faster.\n\n• Your memory card is in USA/Card A (EUR/Card A for a PAL disc) and your settings in port_settings.ini, in the user folder shown above.</string>
