    <string name="primedgun_about_credits_text"><b>Created by</b>\nNobbie and iChris4\n\n<b>Quest Port &amp; Early VR Development</b>\niChris4\nCreator of Dolphin ReduX for PC and Quest. Ported PrimedGun to Quest, contributed early visor effect fixes, and ported the Metroid Prime override from Dolphin Hydra.\n\n<b>Development References</b>\nMetroid Prime decompilation project\nMetaforce\nPrimeHack\n\n<b>Development Assistance</b>\nCodex — debugging, system integration, and iterative development.\n\n<b>Early Playtesting</b>\nGeekyGami\nLucaspec72\nTorchRing\ndetective_yoshi\nPHA3ESH1FTGAMES\nretrovideogamer\nSamevi\nMochu\nVideoGameEsoterica\nVRified Games\n\n<b>Quest Playtesting</b>\nbudwheizzah\n\n<b>Special Thanks</b>\nThe Metroid Prime modding community, for the resources and research that helped make PrimedGun possible.\nThe Dolphin team.</string>
    <string name="primedgun_section_native_port">Native Port</string>
    <string name="primedgun_about_native_port_text">• PrimedGun v2 runs on a native build of the Metroid Prime decompilation (PrimeDecomp), through Odran\'s MetroidPrimePort, drawn by Aurora.\n\n• Its OpenXR stereo rendering, head tracking and PrimedGun controls build on the OpenXR work from Wiicompiled VR.</string>
